---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Thank You — Chauncy" description="Your purchase is complete. Download Chauncy here.">

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container ty-container">
      <h1>You're in. Let's get you set up.</h1>
      <p class="ty-sub">Your receipt is on its way to your email. Here's your download.</p>

      <div class="downloads">
        <div class="download-card">
          <h3>Windows</h3>
          <p>Chauncy for Windows (.exe, ~210MB)</p>
          <a href="https://chauncy.dev/downloads/Chauncy_Setup.exe" class="btn btn-primary">Download for Windows</a>
          <p class="dl-note">Requires Windows 10 or later. Download and run Chauncy.exe directly. No installation required. Chauncy will initialize your database on first launch — this takes about 30 seconds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="download-card">
          <h3>Linux</h3>
          <p>Chauncy AppImage (~145MB)</p>
          <a href="https://chauncy.dev/downloads/Chauncy-1.0.0-linux-x86_64.AppImage" class="btn btn-secondary">Download for Linux</a>
          <p class="dl-note">Mark the AppImage as executable and run it. No installation required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="setup-note">
        <p><strong>Note:</strong> Chauncy opens in your default browser when it launches. This is normal — it's a desktop app that uses your browser as its interface. Nothing is sent to the internet unless you configure an AI provider.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="getting-started">
        <h2>Getting started</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Install and launch Chauncy</li>
          <li>Drop a folder of documents into the import area</li>
          <li>Wait for indexing to complete (speed depends on collection size)</li>
          <li>Ask your first question</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="help-note">
        <p>Need help? Email <a href="mailto:support@chauncy.dev">support@chauncy.dev</a> or check the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .ty-container {
    max-width: 680px;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  .ty-sub {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .downloads {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .download-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .download-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .download-card > p:first-of-type {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .dl-note {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-align: left;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .setup-note {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .setup-note p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .getting-started {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .getting-started h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .getting-started ol {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .help-note {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .help-note p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
